{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4dec468a368c8cbe8d00d7d944e7378854cde64591c15b1bd8039f54920e9fd4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"itayinbarr/little-coder@a9e467f2be43 snapshot c1c886905f97db58","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1e16c2ab009061fe35103dd066397a1329ad9c06cad80b7976fe9423467961aa"],"source_ids":["src_c1b1b23c37b75283a09e43706b413d49"],"text":"little-coder is built on pi as a plain dependency, adding roughly 30 extensions, 30 skill markdown files, and a Python benchmark harness under .pi/extensions/, skills/, and benchmarks/.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_571802fdf1548175cb5390dbb2a94c0d4733ad8a71d05a1b585d47718cc9d18d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"itayinbarr/little-coder@a9e467f2be43 snapshot c1c886905f97db58","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_28557ca63a8720c8a459ec45a9e87cf36cd0ec7d66b192b904d2b5e2a965c987","slc_6ebb1c0688f39fcfb56d32362124729d0019658678666ec9ff2d5298b56ad33f","slc_8138375cb91a556ad42817ec1481b3d6a85890dffb0713b6b4848bcd326cc6ca","slc_8823eea36f005804d910163066ffeb0861b5d3d392c511b3c5d0c274e0c761dc","slc_a50309802b199fff08b001adb38737abea9e82ffce4fbf827f045f15f0c21d1c"],"source_ids":["src_c1b1b23c37b75283a09e43706b413d49"],"text":"Requires Node.js 22.19+; installable via a curl script, npm install -g, or bun, and the launcher is a Node script so Node must remain on PATH even when installed with bun.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_649ede035a5382d279aabbe58ef0c8fd1bc9447aea1ea2316ee7b2bc97dc2c06","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"itayinbarr/little-coder@a9e467f2be43 snapshot c1c886905f97db58","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5da78943d93fd78250940d1a4e51db328dc1ec2672c96fef1bddcb5caaa0a764"],"source_ids":["src_c1b1b23c37b75283a09e43706b413d49"],"text":"Background jobs outlive a turn but not the session: they run in their own process group, are reaped on shutdown, and carry a watchdog that kills the group if little-coder's pid disappears.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6b70715448dfe412c78f18c59a299169b75c1402dec1d394187c1a417e64abf0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"itayinbarr/little-coder@a9e467f2be43 snapshot c1c886905f97db58","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4e2adea212b8f4e0819258c51eb1373ab95bf355981f87c826b8313f650122e3","slc_ea902f7d94caa7dbff7e6474ade9f2950859479762b7b52850ee2293be9eef4a"],"source_ids":["src_c1b1b23c37b75283a09e43706b413d49"],"text":"Every command in a chain is judged individually, and any shell write via redirects, tee, or dd of= is refused; LITTLE_CODER_PERMISSION_MODE offers auto, accept-all, and manual modes.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6eae57985efec0d87f8f20521e37212c48ba33a2d01ee70da2f97fa684fe0da5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"itayinbarr/little-coder@a9e467f2be43 snapshot c1c886905f97db58","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_237b17644108774f701d7edd8c773372aa1ef774512a81e8559a556bfb075f96","slc_486c7b00122aa152a70a329c7ee68751f0cddff1a6297b68f0e29138873c75a9","slc_b8a1cbd42cd08a92a4e6edaef766f47bf11b9372daeb7c595f33f5fbdecdf4b0"],"source_ids":["src_c1b1b23c37b75283a09e43706b413d49"],"text":"Published results include Aider Polyglot 45.56% (Qwen3.5-9B) and 78.67% (Qwen3.6-35B-A3B), Terminal-Bench-Core 40.0%, Terminal-Bench 2.0 leaderboard 24.6%±3.2, and GAIA validation 40.00%, all on an 8 GB VRAM laptop with no cloud inference.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9d30a390208c87bd250b0333f8b31fa608e9950bc43de6c550de6fd49190c835","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"itayinbarr/little-coder@a9e467f2be43 snapshot c1c886905f97db58","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9b0079c04fc3d307fdf9cb2c4b1cc410e9d4d84e133c15677f01187307c8ebc0"],"source_ids":["src_c1b1b23c37b75283a09e43706b413d49"],"text":"Users can opt into extra extensions via ~/.config/little-coder/extensions/, the LITTLE_CODER_EXTRA_EXTENSIONS variable, or a --with-pi-extensions relaunch; /extensions shows what loaded.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a77b998a9e8b61909a17fa87a3daf1382d8639e325a8fd2201dfc8f2863de9c5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"itayinbarr/little-coder@a9e467f2be43 snapshot c1c886905f97db58","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_38c661a53b11be6ba8fb08c95e859be4c823875792f3b33ee0be553f8687d1a0","slc_6d7151b8dff62d4aec6cae9b26ed3e961b805ba1b38d02578d1d3113adf878ac","slc_b5036b71b44bb3e942a6826595f5cb6d5faa1a98e9ea84b2e6344eb3fe35ca47"],"source_ids":["src_c1b1b23c37b75283a09e43706b413d49"],"text":"ShellStart runs background jobs with wake_on triggers (exit, regex match, silence, every_n_matches), delivering bounded excerpts plus exit code, with ShellLog, ShellList, ShellSend, and ShellStop companions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad"}
