{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d348bdaaf8e1252b4a40fc5a72530dedfd8a4bb573100306a6f25ba387f9e63d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"itayinbarr/little-coder@a9e467f2be43 snapshot c1c886905f97db58","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7e7b782bb649f14dbd711a5be9ce3fbac6ac703c528f68c61d38fa051f39bf93","slc_f4bb5d1ed14669e8eecb8fda6516ef2a96a1266b9dbf81a262ef6ff4d504651d"],"source_ids":["src_c1b1b23c37b75283a09e43706b413d49"],"text":"Per-phase model selection lets planning and implementation use different models via /plan-model, /action-model, and /model-handover auto|manual, with handover deferred until implementation begins.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d55d4e929c27f7aeb1c5d0a5a2dc62f8f4d5c1940e6cb80616cd2084af09eb16","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"itayinbarr/little-coder@a9e467f2be43 snapshot c1c886905f97db58","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_640d4c7fe37630757074da1496b65f05ff2fcfbb1f68903360e6c0c1b7032f30"],"source_ids":["src_c1b1b23c37b75283a09e43706b413d49"],"text":"Plan Mode (ctrl+q or --plan-mode) researches with sub-coders, asks 1-3 clarifying questions, writes a plan, and /implement starts a fresh session on the action model; Esc cancels.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad"}
