{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e5dc8582abf328cc8f7666f6585d4704f093d9c7cc0cb6611d31726d874e4172","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"itayinbarr/little-coder@a9e467f2be43 snapshot c1c886905f97db58","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_11c1534b52f73a7a7b33c002e3e7e0d703258f93241f4c8f7da6f95b2903720b","slc_18bddd12d31b0979a0ed00b9dac05dc88aff10424cc06f01a432b58137a71ee0","slc_ad52d56ddc4a259e976ea1d1f53dd7779a0c5c6b732911e11fcdee7b66cb6b47"],"source_ids":["src_c1b1b23c37b75283a09e43706b413d49"],"text":"The project targets coding agents for small local models on consumer laptops, with Phase 2 focused on operating large, messy markdown knowledge bases token-efficiently.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e91dc5eae3390e0b09056f77d137ac6333d38a0517c8ef6cbbaab84095a5d865","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"itayinbarr/little-coder@a9e467f2be43 snapshot c1c886905f97db58","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e87501de43e01ebea2607cd6cfbf1ac95ca8b8e2ea2262bf19904f6605fd3825"],"source_ids":["src_c1b1b23c37b75283a09e43706b413d49"],"text":"Shell calls are gated against a built-in safe-prefix whitelist before pi's confirmation flow; rm and sudo are excluded, and LITTLE_CODER_BASH_ALLOW adds prefixes per deployment.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_fa946be99f49e15972e8f99e58c2d792cb0da95917c4b25019266369dd2f55b8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"itayinbarr/little-coder@a9e467f2be43 snapshot c1c886905f97db58","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d41a0020ab89dffe9aa9da24d34b3cc5a074c07ef243b431eab40da0daab08a4"],"source_ids":["src_c1b1b23c37b75283a09e43706b413d49"],"text":"A compaction watchdog checks context at every turn boundary and triggers pi's compaction at 80% of the window, tunable via LITTLE_CODER_COMPACT_AT_PERCENT, and pauses automatic compaction if a pass frees too little.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_fe7a4ac89485c78a31919f0da9600f40d78c2026c0dd63664e0a09de80a16014","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"itayinbarr/little-coder@a9e467f2be43 snapshot c1c886905f97db58","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9a498e738178c1ed33ff8c5e04d02cd72dec4910feb2ea5d559e2a72d89cabfc"],"source_ids":["src_c1b1b23c37b75283a09e43706b413d49"],"text":"The launcher runs pi with --no-extensions and wires in only the bundled set, keeping cold-start context near 7k tokens and making loaded behavior fixed at ship time.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:05:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fa984a64620448b9b9202de0fc593dad"}
